title = "Lab logbook"
body = "EEE Lab 2, night shift log.\n\n22:40 Phase test on the generator feed from the workshops. The meters read power going DOWN into the ground, not out of it.\n\n23:10 Something is drawing current under the ME workshops. A lot of it.\n\n23:58 The scopes show a heartbeat on the mains. I've locked the genset key in the key box. Code: the course number of my night class, room 304. Nobody runs that generator."
